{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "用左右边界维护最小值所在区间，并始终比较中点与右端点。若中点更大，最小值一定在右半边；否则中点可能就是答案，保留中点并收缩右边界。示例经过三次比较后，左右边界在数值 0 处重合，时间复杂度为 O(log n)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>寻找旋转排序数组中的最小值</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}main{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}h1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}p{margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;color:#8d8d8d}.mono,.value,.index,.comparison,.complexity{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}.array{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:8px}.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;text-align:center;transition:.35s}.value{font-size:14px;color:#d4d4d4}.index{margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.markers{min-height:14px;margin-top:2px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}.marker{display:inline-block;margin:1px;padding:1px 4px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px}.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.active .value{color:#fff}.cell.range{background:#26384a;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.discarded{opacity:.32}.status{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}.step-box,.rule-box{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}.step-title{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:4px}.comparison{font-size:13px;color:#d4d4d4;margin:4px 0}.decision{font-size:12px}.rules{display:grid;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}.rule{border-left:3px solid #3c3c3c;padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;font-size:12px}.rule.on{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}.dot{height:3px;flex:1;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:3px}.dot.on{background:#3794ff}.answer{color:#d4d4d4;font-size:13px}.answer strong{color:#3794ff;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px}.complexity{color:#9cdcfe;font-size:12px}</style></head><body><main><section class=\"panel\"><h1>二分定位旋转断点</h1><p>示例：<span class=\"mono\">nums = [4,5,6,7,0,1,2]</span></p><p>比较 <span class=\"mono\">nums[mid]</span> 与 <span class=\"mono\">nums[right]</span>，每次排除一半区间。</p><div id=\"array\" class=\"array\"></div></section><section class=\"panel status\"><div class=\"step-box\"><div id=\"stepTitle\" class=\"step-title\"></div><div id=\"bounds\" class=\"mono\"></div><div id=\"comparison\" class=\"comparison\"></div><div id=\"decision\" class=\"decision\"></div><div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div></div><div class=\"rule-box\"><div>判断规则</div><div class=\"rules\"><div id=\"ruleRight\" class=\"rule\"><span class=\"mono\">nums[mid] &gt; nums[right]</span><br>最小值在右侧，令 <span class=\"mono\">left = mid + 1</span></div><div id=\"ruleLeft\" class=\"rule\"><span class=\"mono\">nums[mid] &lt; nums[right]</span><br>最小值在左侧或中点，令 <span class=\"mono\">right = mid</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"panel\"><div id=\"answer\" class=\"answer\">搜索尚未结束</div><p class=\"complexity\">区间每轮减半：时间 O(log n)，空间 O(1)</p></section></main><script>const nums=[4,5,6,7,0,1,2];const steps=[{l:0,r:6,m:3,title:'第 1 次比较',cmp:'7 > 2',decision:'中点落在较大的左段，索引 0～3 不可能是最小值。下一步令 left = 4。',rule:'right'},{l:4,r:6,m:5,title:'第 2 次比较',cmp:'1 < 2',decision:'中点比右端点小，最小值位于索引 4～5。保留中点，令 right = 5。',rule:'left'},{l:4,r:5,m:4,title:'第 3 次比较',cmp:'0 < 1',decision:'继续保留中点并收缩右边界，令 right = 4。',rule:'left'},{l:4,r:4,m:4,title:'边界重合',cmp:'left = right = 4',decision:'候选区间只剩一个元素，它就是旋转数组的最小值。',rule:'done'}];const array=document.getElementById('array');const progress=document.getElementById('progress');nums.forEach((n,i)=>{const cell=document.createElement('div');cell.className='cell';cell.innerHTML='<div class=\"value\">'+n+'</div><div class=\"index\">下标 '+i+'</div><div class=\"markers\"></div>';array.appendChild(cell)});steps.forEach(()=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='dot';progress.appendChild(d)});let current=0;function render(){const s=steps[current];[...array.children].forEach((cell,i)=>{cell.className='cell';if(i<s.l||i>s.r)cell.classList.add('discarded');else cell.classList.add('range');if(i===s.m)cell.classList.add('active');const tags=[];if(i===s.l)tags.push('left');if(i===s.m)tags.push('mid');if(i===s.r)tags.push('right');cell.querySelector('.markers').innerHTML=tags.map(t=>'<span class=\"marker\">'+t+'</span>').join('')});document.getElementById('stepTitle').textContent=s.title;document.getElementById('bounds').textContent='搜索区间：['+s.l+', '+s.r+']';document.getElementById('comparison').textContent=s.rule==='done'?s.cmp:'nums[mid] 与 nums[right]：'+s.cmp;document.getElementById('decision').textContent=s.decision;document.getElementById('ruleRight').classList.toggle('on',s.rule==='right');document.getElementById('ruleLeft').classList.toggle('on',s.rule==='left');[...progress.children].forEach((d,i)=>d.classList.toggle('on',i===current));document.getElementById('answer').innerHTML=s.rule==='done'?'最小元素：<strong>0</strong>，位于下标 <strong>4</strong>':'搜索尚未结束'}render();setInterval(()=>{current=(current+1)%steps.length;render()},2200);</script></body></html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(log n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(1)",
  "complexity_note": "n 是数组长度, 题目要求元素互不相同. 比较中点与右端点并收缩一半区间, 只维护左右边界和中点; 若允许重复元素, 最坏时间可能退化到 O(n)."
}
